From 0f680a76859d300059579ca60e3f951b0bae9fc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:24:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 0191 peach: graft the 4 missing arm-twist bones (129->133)

Peach lacked ArmL1Sub/ArmL2Sub/ArmR1Sub/ArmR2Sub entirely, so the
name lookup failed and the SDK asserted on entering the game
(log-71/log-73, identical abort backtrace). Graft the 4 bones
(indices 129-132, parents ArmL1/ArmL2/ArmR1/ArmR2, smooth 86-89,
transforms from Mario) into the 4 split part files; Cap/Hand are
unchanged (zeroed parts). Replaces the 0189 split files.
---
 dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/Peach.szs     | Bin 8344231 -> 8344951 bytes
 dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/PeachEye.szs  | Bin 8339542 -> 8340325 bytes
 dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/PeachFace.szs | Bin 8339569 -> 8340289 bytes
 dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/PeachHead.szs | Bin 8340577 -> 8341297 bytes
 4 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

